{
	"type": "excalidraw",
	"version": 2,
	"source": "https://github.com/zsviczian/obsidian-excalidraw-plugin/releases/tag/2.27.3",
	"elements": [
		{
			"id": "hWy7rXYF",
			"type": "text",
			"x": 4242.686481049914,
			"y": 942.3563192755192,
			"width": 665.7393798828125,
			"height": 450,
			"angle": 0,
			"strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
			"backgroundColor": "transparent",
			"fillStyle": "solid",
			"strokeWidth": 2,
			"strokeStyle": "solid",
			"roughness": 1,
			"opacity": 100,
			"groupIds": [],
			"frameId": null,
			"index": "bCB",
			"roundness": null,
			"seed": 85106375,
			"version": 522,
			"versionNonce": 162979401,
			"isDeleted": false,
			"boundElements": [],
			"updated": 1795063059456,
			"created": 1795059585410,
			"link": null,
			"locked": false,
			"text": "Functional req:\n1) Limit transfer based on user balance, daily limit and prior transfer\n2) Customer configure daily limit (bank max), effective immediately\n3) Prevent overdraft (Core Banking owns balance)\n4) Daily allowance resets at 12am (MYT)\n\nNFR :\n1) Scalability : 5M Transaction Per day, 2000QPS on peak\n2) 99.9% Availability (interview target)\n3) Strong consistency > availability\n4) Low latency p99 < 100ms (authorization)\n5) Reliability\n6) Security\n\nCore Entity:\n1) Configuration\n2) DailyUsage\n3) ReservationRecord",
			"fontSize": 20,
			"baseFontSize": null,
			"fontFamily": 5,
			"textAlign": "left",
			"verticalAlign": "top",
			"containerId": null,
			"originalText": "Functional req:\n1) Limit transfer based on user balance, daily limit and prior transfer\n2) Customer configure daily limit (bank max), effective immediately\n3) Prevent overdraft (Core Banking owns balance)\n4) Daily allowance resets at 12am (MYT)\n\nNFR :\n1) Scalability : 5M Transaction Per day, 2000QPS on peak\n2) 99.9% Availability (interview target)\n3) Strong consistency > availability\n4) Low latency p99 < 100ms (authorization)\n5) Reliability\n6) Security\n\nCore Entity:\n1) Configuration\n2) DailyUsage\n3) ReservationRecord",
			"autoResize": true,
			"lineHeight": 1.25,
			"labelPosition": null,
			"hasTextLink": false,
			"rawText": ""
		},
		{
			"id": "iGKhFC2a",
			"type": "text",
			"x": 4243.402688607595,
			"y": 1450,
			"width": 492.1396484375,
			"height": 575,
			"angle": 0,
			"strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
			"backgroundColor": "transparent",
			"fillStyle": "solid",
			"strokeWidth": 2,
			"strokeStyle": "solid",
			"roughness": 1,
			"opacity": 100,
			"groupIds": [],
			"frameId": null,
			"index": "bCC",
			"roundness": null,
			"seed": 597271463,
			"version": 312,
			"versionNonce": 1867723879,
			"isDeleted": false,
			"boundElements": [],
			"updated": 1795063059456,
			"created": 1795060108119,
			"link": null,
			"locked": false,
			"text": "API Design\ngRPC endpoint\ncheckLimit(userId, paymentId, requestId)\nIdemp-key: paymentId (stable requestId on retry)\nResponse => {\n    currentBalance,\n    availableBalance,\n    transferAmount,\n    dailyLimit,\n    availableLimit,\n    tier,\n    decision, reservationId\n}\n\nrollbackReservation(userId, paymentId, requestId)\nIdemp-key : paymentId + operation\n\nconfirmReservation(paymentId, eventId)\ngetReservation(paymentId)\nupdateLimit(userId, dailyLimit)\n\nPayment details / amount from trusted service\nSame paymentId + different payload -> reject",
			"fontSize": 20,
			"baseFontSize": null,
			"fontFamily": 5,
			"textAlign": "left",
			"verticalAlign": "top",
			"containerId": null,
			"originalText": "API Design\ngRPC endpoint\ncheckLimit(userId, paymentId, requestId)\nIdemp-key: paymentId (stable requestId on retry)\nResponse => {\n    currentBalance,\n    availableBalance,\n    transferAmount,\n    dailyLimit,\n    availableLimit,\n    tier,\n    decision, reservationId\n}\n\nrollbackReservation(userId, paymentId, requestId)\nIdemp-key : paymentId + operation\n\nconfirmReservation(paymentId, eventId)\ngetReservation(paymentId)\nupdateLimit(userId, dailyLimit)\n\nPayment details / amount from trusted service\nSame paymentId + different payload -> reject",
			"autoResize": true,
			"lineHeight": 1.25,
			"labelPosition": null,
			"hasTextLink": false,
			"rawText": ""
		},
